<body lang=EN-US style='tab-interval:.5in'>

<div class=WordSection1>

<div style='mso-element:para-border-div;border:none;border-bottom:solid #222222 1.5pt;
padding:0in 0in 5.0pt 0in'>

<h1><span style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman";
color:#111111'>New Architecture Document — English Translation<o:p></o:p></span></h1>

</div>

<p><strong><span style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;
color:#111111'>Source:</span></strong><span style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:
"Calibri",sans-serif;color:#111111'> new architecture.docx<br>
<strong><span style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif'>Purpose:</span></strong>
Simple English translation so the team can understand the full idea.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<div style='border:none;border-left:solid #555555 3.0pt;padding:0in 0in 0in 9.0pt;
margin-top:9.0pt;margin-bottom:9.0pt'>

<p class=MsoNormal style='background:#F4F4F4'><strong><span style='font-size:
11.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman";
color:#111111'>Main idea in one sentence<span class=GramE>:</span></span></strong><span
style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:
"Times New Roman";color:#111111'><br>
Do not build a normal IT dashboard. Build a digital production control room
that makes the production manager feel, within 10 seconds: “I have full control
of my production.” <o:p></o:p></span></p>

</div>

<div style='mso-element:para-border-div;border:none;border-bottom:solid #999999 1.0pt;
mso-border-bottom-alt:solid #999999 .75pt;padding:0in 0in 2.0pt 0in'>

<h2><span style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman";
color:#111111'>1. Who is the user?<o:p></o:p></span></h2>

</div>

<ul type=disc>
 <li class=MsoNormal style='color:#111111;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:
     auto;mso-list:l8 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in'><span style='font-size:
     11.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>Production
     manager, about 50–60 years old<o:p></o:p></span></li>
 <li class=MsoNormal style='color:#111111;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:
     auto;mso-list:l8 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in'><span style='font-size:
     11.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>He
     does not care about “AI is cool”<o:p></o:p></span></li>
 <li class=MsoNormal style='color:#111111;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:
     auto;mso-list:l8 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in'><span style='font-size:
     11.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>He
     cares about: fewer stoppages, less scrap, fewer calls, less stress, better
     decisions, control<o:p></o:p></span></li>
 <li class=MsoNormal style='color:#111111;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:
     auto;mso-list:l8 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in'><span style='font-size:
     11.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>AI
     works in the background. Production stays in the front.<o:p></o:p></span></li>
</ul>

<div style='mso-element:para-border-div;border:none;border-bottom:solid #999999 1.0pt;
mso-border-bottom-alt:solid #999999 .75pt;padding:0in 0in 2.0pt 0in'>

<h2><span style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman";
color:#111111'>2. Design philosophy<o:p></o:p></span></h2>

</div>

<p><span style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;color:#111111'>The
UI should feel like: Tesla Energy, power-plant control room, SCADA, Apple
design, strategy game.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<ul type=disc>
 <li class=MsoNormal style='color:#111111;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:
     auto;mso-list:l10 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list .5in'><span style='font-size:
     11.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>Professional,
     not playful, not colorful<o:p></o:p></span></li>
 <li class=MsoNormal style='color:#111111;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:
     auto;mso-list:l10 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list .5in'><span style='font-size:
     11.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>Dark
     industrial background (in the original design brief)<o:p></o:p></span></li>
 <li class=MsoNormal style='color:#111111;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:
     auto;mso-list:l10 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list .5in'><span style='font-size:
     11.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>Nice
     animations, lots of whitespace<o:p></o:p></span></li>
 <li class=MsoNormal style='color:#111111;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:
     auto;mso-list:l10 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list .5in'><span style='font-size:
     11.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>No
     overloaded tables<o:p></o:p></span></li>
</ul>

<div style='mso-element:para-border-div;border:none;border-bottom:solid #999999 1.0pt;
mso-border-bottom-alt:solid #999999 .75pt;padding:0in 0in 2.0pt 0in'>

<h2><span style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman";
color:#111111'>3. What the home page must show<o:p></o:p></span></h2>

</div>

<ul type=disc>
 <li class=MsoNormal style='color:#111111;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:
     auto;mso-list:l11 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:list .5in'><span style='font-size:
     11.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>Title:
     AI Operations Center / Digital Production Control Room<o:p></o:p></span></li>
 <li class=MsoNormal style='color:#111111;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:
     auto;mso-list:l11 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:list .5in'><span style='font-size:
     11.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>Big
     status cards: production running / stopped / heating<o:p></o:p></span></li>
 <li class=MsoNormal style='color:#111111;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:
     auto;mso-list:l11 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:list .5in'><span style='font-size:
     11.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>OEE,
     next maintenance, active warnings<o:p></o:p></span></li>
 <li class=MsoNormal style='color:#111111;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:
     auto;mso-list:l11 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:list .5in'><span style='font-size:
     11.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>Connected
     machines (example: 1 of 20)<o:p></o:p></span></li>
 <li class=MsoNormal style='color:#111111;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:
     auto;mso-list:l11 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:list .5in'><span style='font-size:
     11.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>Digitalization
     Progress<o:p></o:p></span></li>
 <li class=MsoNormal style='color:#111111;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:
     auto;mso-list:l11 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:list .5in'><span style='font-size:
     11.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>Prediction
     Readiness<o:p></o:p></span></li>
 <li class=MsoNormal style='color:#111111;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:
     auto;mso-list:l11 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:list .5in'><span style='font-size:
     11.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>Current
     machine values, warnings, expected risks<o:p></o:p></span></li>
 <li class=MsoNormal style='color:#111111;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:
     auto;mso-list:l11 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:list .5in'><span style='font-size:
     11.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>Missing
     data sources<o:p></o:p></span></li>
 <li class=MsoNormal style='color:#111111;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:
     auto;mso-list:l11 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:list .5in'><span style='font-size:
     11.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>Locked
     future functions<o:p></o:p></span></li>
 <li class=MsoNormal style='color:#111111;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:
     auto;mso-list:l11 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:list .5in'><span style='font-size:
     11.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>Factory
     map: Office IT → Edge Gateway → Extruder → Feeder → Granulator → Screen
     Changer → Cooling → more machines<o:p></o:p></span></li>
</ul>

<p><strong><span style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;
color:#111111'>Machine colors:</span></strong><span style='font-size:11.0pt;
font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;color:#111111'> green = active, gray =
missing/not connected, red = alarm.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<div style='mso-element:para-border-div;border:none;border-bottom:solid #999999 1.0pt;
mso-border-bottom-alt:solid #999999 .75pt;padding:0in 0in 2.0pt 0in'>

<h2><span style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman";
color:#111111'>4. Important sales idea: “Gamification”<o:p></o:p></span></h2>

</div>

<p><span style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;color:#111111'>Always
show how far digitalization has come.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<ul type=disc>
 <li class=MsoNormal style='color:#111111;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:
     auto;mso-list:l9 level1 lfo4;tab-stops:list .5in'><span style='font-size:
     11.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>Progress
     bar example: 35% digitalization complete<o:p></o:p></span></li>
 <li class=MsoNormal style='color:#111111;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:
     auto;mso-list:l9 level1 lfo4;tab-stops:list .5in'><span style='font-size:
     11.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>Still
     missing: connect 19 machines, machine network, quality data, maintenance
     data<o:p></o:p></span></li>
 <li class=MsoNormal style='color:#111111;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:
     auto;mso-list:l9 level1 lfo4;tab-stops:list .5in'><span style='font-size:
     11.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>Everything
     clickable<o:p></o:p></span></li>
</ul>

<p><span style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;color:#111111'>Also
show “Prediction Quality / Readiness” with bars for:<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<ul type=disc>
 <li class=MsoNormal style='color:#111111;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:
     auto;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo5;tab-stops:list .5in'><span style='font-size:
     11.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>Sensor
     data<o:p></o:p></span></li>
 <li class=MsoNormal style='color:#111111;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:
     auto;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo5;tab-stops:list .5in'><span style='font-size:
     11.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>Machine
     status<o:p></o:p></span></li>
 <li class=MsoNormal style='color:#111111;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:
     auto;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo5;tab-stops:list .5in'><span style='font-size:
     11.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>Quality
     data<o:p></o:p></span></li>
 <li class=MsoNormal style='color:#111111;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:
     auto;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo5;tab-stops:list .5in'><span style='font-size:
     11.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>Maintenance
     data<o:p></o:p></span></li>
</ul>

<p><span style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;color:#111111'>Example
message: “Current prediction readiness is 74%. Connecting quality and
maintenance data can raise it above 90%.”<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<div style='mso-element:para-border-div;border:none;border-bottom:solid #999999 1.0pt;
mso-border-bottom-alt:solid #999999 .75pt;padding:0in 0in 2.0pt 0in'>

<h2><span style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman";
color:#111111'>5. Locked features<o:p></o:p></span></h2>

</div>

<p><span style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;color:#111111'>Show
future modules with a lock icon:<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<ul type=disc>
 <li class=MsoNormal style='color:#111111;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:
     auto;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo6;tab-stops:list .5in'><span style='font-size:
     11.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>Scrap
     prediction → needs quality data<o:p></o:p></span></li>
 <li class=MsoNormal style='color:#111111;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:
     auto;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo6;tab-stops:list .5in'><span style='font-size:
     11.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>Tool
     remaining life → needs maintenance data<o:p></o:p></span></li>
 <li class=MsoNormal style='color:#111111;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:
     auto;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo6;tab-stops:list .5in'><span style='font-size:
     11.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>Energy
     optimization → needs energy meters<o:p></o:p></span></li>
 <li class=MsoNormal style='color:#111111;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:
     auto;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo6;tab-stops:list .5in'><span style='font-size:
     11.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>Quality
     forecast → needs quality measurements<o:p></o:p></span></li>
</ul>

<p><span style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;color:#111111'>Feeling
for the customer: “We can grow more and more.”<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<div style='mso-element:para-border-div;border:none;border-bottom:solid #999999 1.0pt;
mso-border-bottom-alt:solid #999999 .75pt;padding:0in 0in 2.0pt 0in'>

<h2><span style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman";
color:#111111'>6. Screens / modules described in the document<o:p></o:p></span></h2>

</div>

<ol start=1 type=1>
 <li class=MsoNormal style='color:#111111;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:
     auto;mso-list:l12 level1 lfo7;tab-stops:list .5in'><span style='font-size:
     11.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>Production
     overview (home)<o:p></o:p></span></li>
 <li class=MsoNormal style='color:#111111;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:
     auto;mso-list:l12 level1 lfo7;tab-stops:list .5in'><span style='font-size:
     11.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>Factory
     map<o:p></o:p></span></li>
 <li class=MsoNormal style='color:#111111;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:
     auto;mso-list:l12 level1 lfo7;tab-stops:list .5in'><span style='font-size:
     11.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>Digitalization
     progress<o:p></o:p></span></li>
 <li class=MsoNormal style='color:#111111;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:
     auto;mso-list:l12 level1 lfo7;tab-stops:list .5in'><span style='font-size:
     11.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>AI
     Readiness score<o:p></o:p></span></li>
 <li class=MsoNormal style='color:#111111;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:
     auto;mso-list:l12 level1 lfo7;tab-stops:list .5in'><span style='font-size:
