<p><strong><span style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;
color:#111111'>Do not show “AI Accuracy 71%”</span></strong><span
style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;color:#111111'> until
a model is validated with real events. Until then use “Prediction Readiness” or
“AI Readiness”.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<div style='mso-element:para-border-div;border:none;border-bottom:solid #999999 1.0pt;
mso-border-bottom-alt:solid #999999 .75pt;padding:0in 0in 2.0pt 0in'>

<h2><span style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman";
color:#111111'>9. What already exists vs what is missing<o:p></o:p></span></h2>

</div>

<p><strong><span style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;
color:#111111'>Already available (approx.):</span></strong><span
style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;color:#111111'>
edge/AI server, machine/SQL data, live sensors, states
(OFF/READY/HEATING/PRODUCTION/COOLING), dashboard, sensors, material profiles, <span
class=GramE>first</span> baseline/rules.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p><strong><span style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;
color:#111111'>Still missing for strong prediction:</span></strong><span
style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;color:#111111'>
reliable quality data, maintenance data, material batches, real fault labels,
scrap data, energy, full production orders, strong links between events and
process data.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p><span style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;color:#111111'>So
today the system can monitor well, but cannot honestly predict everything yet.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<div style='mso-element:para-border-div;border:none;border-bottom:solid #999999 1.0pt;
mso-border-bottom-alt:solid #999999 .75pt;padding:0in 0in 2.0pt 0in'>

<h2><span style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman";
color:#111111'>10. Backend architecture idea<o:p></o:p></span></h2>

</div>

<p><span style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;color:#111111'>Do
not hardcode every new feature. Build a data-source + capability system.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<ul type=disc>
 <li class=MsoNormal style='color:#111111;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:
     auto;mso-list:l7 level1 lfo9;tab-stops:list .5in'><span class=SpellE><strong><span
     style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:
     "Times New Roman"'>data_sources</span></strong></span><span
     style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:
     "Times New Roman"'> — which sources exist, how fresh/complete they are<o:p></o:p></span></li>
 <li class=MsoNormal style='color:#111111;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:
     auto;mso-list:l7 level1 lfo9;tab-stops:list .5in'><span class=SpellE><strong><span
     style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:
     "Times New Roman"'>feature_capabilities</span></strong></span><span
     style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:
     "Times New Roman"'> — what each feature needs<o:p></o:p></span></li>
 <li class=MsoNormal style='color:#111111;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:
     auto;mso-list:l7 level1 lfo9;tab-stops:list .5in'><strong><span
     style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:
     "Times New Roman"'>feature status</span></strong><span style='font-size:
     11.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>:
     LOCKED → SETUP_REQUIRED → COLLECTING_DATA → TRAINING → VALIDATION_REQUIRED
     → ACTIVE<o:p></o:p></span></li>
 <li class=MsoNormal style='color:#111111;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:
     auto;mso-list:l7 level1 lfo9;tab-stops:list .5in'><span class=SpellE><strong><span
     style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:
     "Times New Roman"'>machine_integrations</span></strong></span><span
     style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:
     "Times New Roman"'> — progress per machine (example: 1 of 20 connected)<o:p></o:p></span></li>
 <li class=MsoNormal style='color:#111111;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:
     auto;mso-list:l7 level1 lfo9;tab-stops:list .5in'><span class=SpellE><strong><span
     style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:
     "Times New Roman"'>model_versions</span></strong></span><span
     style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:
     "Times New Roman"'> — precision, recall, F1, false alarms, warning time<o:p></o:p></span></li>
 <li class=MsoNormal style='color:#111111;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:
     auto;mso-list:l7 level1 lfo9;tab-stops:list .5in'><strong><span
     style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:
     "Times New Roman"'>Capability Engine</span></strong><span
     style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:
     "Times New Roman"'> — decides automatically which features are open or
     locked<o:p></o:p></span></li>
 <li class=MsoNormal style='color:#111111;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:
     auto;mso-list:l7 level1 lfo9;tab-stops:list .5in'><strong><span
     style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:
     "Times New Roman"'>Data Quality Service</span></strong><span
     style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:
     "Times New Roman"'> — missing values, jumps, gaps, offline sensors, etc.<o:p></o:p></span></li>
 <li class=MsoNormal style='color:#111111;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:
     auto;mso-list:l7 level1 lfo9;tab-stops:list .5in'><strong><span
     style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:
     "Times New Roman"'>Event Normalization</span></strong><span
     style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:
     "Times New Roman"'> — map different sensor names to one standard name<o:p></o:p></span></li>
</ul>

<p><span style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;color:#111111'>Central
homepage API idea:<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p><strong><span style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;
color:#111111'>GET /<span class=SpellE>api</span>/v1/operations-center/overview</span></strong><span
style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;color:#111111'><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<div style='mso-element:para-border-div;border:none;border-bottom:solid #999999 1.0pt;
mso-border-bottom-alt:solid #999999 .75pt;padding:0in 0in 2.0pt 0in'>

<h2><span style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman";
color:#111111'>11. Fast demo plan (most important practical part)<o:p></o:p></span></h2>

</div>

<div style='border:none;border-left:solid #555555 3.0pt;padding:0in 0in 0in 9.0pt;
margin-top:9.0pt;margin-bottom:9.0pt'>

