font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman";
color:#111111'>This is a <strong><span style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif'>fast
demo redesign</span></strong>, not a complete rebuild.<br>
Keep existing backend/functions. Add a new industrial skin and one Operations
Center page. <o:p></o:p></span></p>

