     connected machine + 19 gray machines<o:p></o:p></span></li>
 <li class=MsoNormal style='color:#111111;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:
     auto;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo10;tab-stops:list .5in'><span style='font-size:
     11.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>Progress
     / readiness indicators<o:p></o:p></span></li>
 <li class=MsoNormal style='color:#111111;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:
     auto;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo10;tab-stops:list .5in'><span style='font-size:
     11.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>Locked
     modules<o:p></o:p></span></li>
 <li class=MsoNormal style='color:#111111;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:
     auto;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo10;tab-stops:list .5in'><span style='font-size:
     11.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>Demo
     or rule-based warnings<o:p></o:p></span></li>
 <li class=MsoNormal style='color:#111111;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:
     auto;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo10;tab-stops:list .5in'><span style='font-size:
     11.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>Desktop
     layout<o:p></o:p></span></li>
</ul>

<p><strong><span style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;
color:#111111'>Stage 2 — Connect existing system</span></strong><span
style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;color:#111111'><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<ul type=disc>
 <li class=MsoNormal style='color:#111111;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:
     auto;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo11;tab-stops:list .5in'><span style='font-size:
     11.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>Replace
     demo values with live values<o:p></o:p></span></li>
 <li class=MsoNormal style='color:#111111;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:
     auto;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo11;tab-stops:list .5in'><span style='font-size:
     11.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>Connect
     real machine state, alarms, sensors<o:p></o:p></span></li>
 <li class=MsoNormal style='color:#111111;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:
     auto;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo11;tab-stops:list .5in'><span style='font-size:
     11.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>Keep
     missing modules locked<o:p></o:p></span></li>
</ul>

<p><span style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;color:#111111'>Every
value must have a source status: LIVE, RULE_BASED, DERIVED, SIMULATED,
MODEL_PREDICTION, MANUAL.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p><span style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;color:#111111'>Never
present simulated values as validated AI accuracy.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<div style='mso-element:para-border-div;border:none;border-bottom:solid #999999 1.0pt;
mso-border-bottom-alt:solid #999999 .75pt;padding:0in 0in 2.0pt 0in'>

